  "_format": "Each vector: id; class (the class under test, absent for cross-class vectors); parts (joined with no separator to form the text); findings (the exact list of {line, class, sha256} the scanner must return, ordered by line and then by class order; line is 1-based; one finding per line and class; sha256 lists, in order of first match, the distinct non-overlapping leftmost matches on the rewritten line, each as the first 16 lowercase hex characters of SHA-256 over the matched bytes; empty findings means the text must be clean); rule (optional, the scanner rule the vector exists to test; today only one-finding-per-line-and-class); note (optional)."
